  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA driver crossed 478 miles in 9 hours and 15 minutes. Use your calculator to find her average speed to the nearest mile per hour.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert the second quantity to a decimal.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert the second quantity to a decimal.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e60 minutes \u003d one hour, and 15 minutes \u003d 0.25 hour.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo, 9 hours and 15 minutes is the same as 9.25 hours.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the ratio using the \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18457\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qfrac.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18457\u0026quot;,154)\"\u003e key.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the ratio using the \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18458\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qfrac.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18458\u0026quot;,154)\"\u003e key. Key in\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18459\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18460\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18461\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q8.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18462\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qfrac.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18462\u0026quot;,154)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18463\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q9.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18464\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18464\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18465\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18466\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_7_50/f-50-7-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
